@* Read-only view-as banner (ADR-137). Renders nothing unless the signed-in principal is a view-as
   token, so every host can place it unconditionally. role="status": the view is the staff user's own
   choice, so it is announced politely rather than as an error (WCAG 4.1.3). *@

@if (_viewAs)
{
    <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Warning" Dense="true" Class="mmca-view-as-banner mb-2" role="status">
        <span>@L["Auth.ViewAs.Banner", _viewedName, FormatRemaining()]</span>
        <MudButton Variant="Variant.Text" Color="Color.Inherit" Size="Size.Small" Class="ml-2"
                   Disabled="_ending" OnClick="EndAsync">@L["Auth.ViewAs.End"]</MudButton>
    </MudAlert>
}
